Error [E0067]: `__TablePlan` is reserved for Jet
  --> query_plan_private_nominal_cannot_be_named_by_user_code.jet:1:16
    |
  1 | use core.data.[__TablePlan]
    |                ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Double-underscore names belong to the compiler, generated binders, debugger, serializer, and tools
 Fix: Rename it without the second leading underscore
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0067
